2. As per the case of the petitioners/claimants, on 06.08.2017 Ms. Savita (since deceased) along with her son Rahul was going to her 1 of 9 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:028053 FAO-6769-2018(O&M) -2- parental home at village Bhainswal, District Sonipat from village Ismaila, Rohtak, on motorcycle bearing registration No.HR-12H-4611; the motorcycle was being driven by Rahul on which Ms. Savita (since deceased) was sitting as a pillion rider; when they reached near Kharkhoda Bypass at Sampla Road, Kharkhoda, in the meantime, offending truck being driven by respondent No.1 Sandeep in a rash and negligent manner came from Delhi side and hit the aforesaid motorcycle, as a result Ms.Savita sustained multiple injuries, which proved fatal;
she was shifted to Community Health Centre, Kharkhoda, where she was declared dead;
postmortem examination on the dead body of Ms. Savita was conducted at General Hospital,
Sonipat.
